|             |            | (SW->HW)   |               |         |        |          | Bitwidth  | Burst Length | Burst Length | Outstanding | Outstanding |                   |
+-------------+------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------+----------+-----------+--------------+--------------+-------------+-------------+-------------------+
| m_axi_gmem0 | READ_ONLY  | 64 -> 64   | 32            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 64        | 64           | 16           | 2           | 16          | BRAM=4            |
| m_axi_gmem1 | WRITE_ONLY | 64 -> 64   | 32            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 64        | 16           | 16           | 16          | 2           | BRAM=4            |
| m_axi_gmem2 | WRITE_ONLY | 64 -> 64   | 32            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 64        | 16           | 64           | 16          | 2           | BRAM=4            |
| m_axi_gmem3 | WRITE_ONLY | 64 -> 64   | 32            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 64        | 16           | 64           | 16          | 2           | BRAM=4            |
+-------------+------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------+----------+-----------+--------------+--------------+-------------+-------------+-------------------+

* S_AXILITE Interfaces
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| Interface     | Data Width | Address Width | Offset | Register |
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| s_axi_control | 32         | 7             | 24     | 0        |
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+

* S_AXILITE Registers
+---------------+-------------------+--------+-------+--------+----------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Interface     | Register          | Offset | Width | Access | Description                      | Bit Fields                                                           |
+---------------+-------------------+--------+-------+--------+----------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
| s_axi_control | CTRL              | 0x00   | 32    | RW     | Control signals                  | 0=AP_START 1=AP_DONE 2=AP_IDLE 3=AP_READY 7=AUTO_RESTART 9=INTERRUPT |
| s_axi_control | GIER              | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register | 0=Enable                                                             |
| s_axi_control | IP_IER            | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                        |
| s_axi_control | IP_ISR            | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                        |
| s_axi_control | ap_return         | 0x10   | 32    | R      | Data signal of ap_return         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | image_r           | 0x18   | 32    | W      | Data signal of image_r           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | blurred           | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of blurred           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | resized           | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of resized           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | selected          | 0x30   | 32    | W      | Data signal of selected          |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | result            | 0x38   | 32    | W      | Data signal of result            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | stats             | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stats             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | level             | 0x48   | 32    | W      | Data signal of level             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | budget            | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of budget            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | high_threshold    | 0x58   | 32    | W      | Data signal of high_threshold    |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | low_threshold     | 0x60   | 32    | W      | Data signal of low_threshold     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | dual_threshold    | 0x68   | 32    | W      | Data signal of dual_threshold    |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | selected_capacity | 0x70   | 32    | W      | Data signal of selected_capacity |                                                                      |
